N1  - [ref45] STAR framework — Two-Stage Attention-based hieRarchical Transformer with sequential temporal and sensor-wise variable attention, plus hierarchical encoder-decoder for multi-scale time dependency. Tested on all four CMAPSS sub-datasets; outperforms prior SOTA at publication. Represents the architectural frontier (attention-based Transformer) that this paper's LSTM backbone sits below; cited in Introduction to frame the deliberate backbone choice.
